Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person1:
	.string "A new universe... Do you think it'll\n"
	.string "have weekends?$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person2:
	.string "Shh! The speech is starting soon!$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person3:
	.string "CYRUS: Look at them. All of them\n"
	.string "waiting for a new world.\p"
	.string "Spirit makes people weak. Soon there\n"
	.string "will be nothing left to make them weak.$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person4:
	.string "LOOKER: Psst! It is I, LOOKER, in my\n"
	.string "finest disguise!\p"
	.string "The BOSS of TEAM GALACTIC is up\n"
	.string "there. I will keep watch down here. Go!$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person5:
	.string "When the new world comes, I'm getting\n"
	.string "a corner office.$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person6:
	.string "The BOSS is about to speak. Stand up\n"
	.string "straight!$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person7:
	.string "A new universe... Do you think it'll\n"
	.string "have weekends?$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person8:
	.string "Shh! The speech is starting soon!$"

Sinnoh_GalacticHqHall_Text_Person9:
